 {
  "name": "匕首心 希望成功",
  "html": "<div class=\"bubble dice rule-dh\" data-mid=\"1\"><div class=\"row1\"><span class=\"caret\">▶</span><span class=\"ttl\">动作掷骰（敏捷） vs 难度 15</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"plab\">希望</span><span class=\"chip\">9</span><span class=\"sep\">+</span><span class=\"plab\">恐惧</span><span class=\"chip\">4</span></span><span class=\"sum\">→ 13</span><span class=\"badge mid\">❌ 希望失败 —— 你获得 1 希望点</span></div><div class=\"detail\"><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>希望骰 d12</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">9</span></span></div><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>恐惧骰 d12</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">4</span></span></div><div class=\"dline comp\"><span class=\"idx\">难度</span><span>15</span></div><div class=\"dline tot\"><span class=\"idx\">合计</span><span>骰点 13 → 13</span></div></div><div class=\"note\">ⓘ 尚未绑定角色卡（或卡上没有「敏捷」），其调整值按 <b>0</b> 计算 —— 用 <b>.st set 敏捷 2</b> 设置<br>ⓘ 合计 13 vs 难度 15　·　希望骰 9 > 恐惧骰 4</div></div>"
 },
 {
  "name": "匕首心 关键成功（同点）",
  "html": "<div class=\"bubble dice rule-dh\" data-mid=\"1\"><div class=\"row1\"><span class=\"caret\">▶</span><span class=\"ttl\">动作掷骰 vs 难度 15</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"plab\">希望</span><span class=\"chip\">6</span><span class=\"sep\">+</span><span class=\"plab\">恐惧</span><span class=\"chip\">6</span></span><span class=\"sum\">→ 12</span><span class=\"badge crit\">✨ 关键成功！—— 双骰同点，必定成功</span></div><div class=\"detail\"><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>希望骰 d12</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">6</span></span></div><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>恐惧骰 d12</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">6</span></span></div><div class=\"dline comp\"><span class=\"idx\">难度</span><span>15</span></div><div class=\"dline tot\"><span class=\"idx\">合计</span><span>骰点 12 → 12</span></div></div><div class=\"note\">ⓘ ✨ 双骰同点（6）—— 关键成功：即使低于难度也必定成功，获得 1 希望点，可清除 1 压力点</div></div>"
 },
 {
  "name": "匕首心 优势 +1d6",
  "html": "<div class=\"bubble dice rule-dh\" data-mid=\"1\"><div class=\"row1\"><span class=\"caret\">▶</span><span class=\"ttl\">动作掷骰（敏捷） vs 难度 15</span><span class=\"mode\">优势</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"plab\">希望</span><span class=\"chip\">8</span><span class=\"sep\">+</span><span class=\"plab\">恐惧</span><span class=\"chip\">3</span><span class=\"sep\">+</span><span class=\"plab\">优势</span><span class=\"chip\">5</span></span><span class=\"sum\">→ 16</span><span class=\"badge ok\">✅ 希望成功 —— 你获得 1 希望点</span></div><div class=\"detail\"><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>希望骰 d12</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">8</span></span></div><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>恐惧骰 d12</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">3</span></span></div><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>优势骰 d6</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">5</span></span></div><div class=\"dline comp\"><span class=\"idx\">难度</span><span>15</span></div><div class=\"dline tot\"><span class=\"idx\">合计</span><span>骰点 16 → 16</span></div></div><div class=\"note\">ⓘ 尚未绑定角色卡（或卡上没有「敏捷」），其调整值按 <b>0</b> 计算 —— 用 <b>.st set 敏捷 2</b> 设置<br>ⓘ 合计 16 vs 难度 15　·　希望骰 8 > 恐惧骰 3<br>ⓘ 优势：额外 +1d6 计入总和；Hope / Fear 判定只看两颗 d12</div></div>"
 },
 {
  "name": "物语 双骰检定",
  "html": "<div class=\"bubble dice rule-fu\" data-mid=\"1\"><div class=\"row1\"><span class=\"caret\">▶</span><span class=\"ttl\">检定 DEX(d8) + INS(d10) vs DL 10</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"plab\">DEX</span><span class=\"chip\">7</span><span class=\"sep\">+</span><span class=\"plab\">INS</span><span class=\"chip\">4</span></span><span class=\"sum\">→ 11</span><span class=\"badge ok\">✅ 成功（合计 11 vs DL 10）</span></div><div class=\"detail\"><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>DEX d8</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">7</span></span></div><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>INS d10</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">4</span></span></div><div class=\"dline comp\"><span class=\"idx\">DL</span><span>10</span></div><div class=\"dline tot\"><span class=\"idx\">合计</span><span>骰点 11 → 11</span></div></div><div class=\"note\">ⓘ 合计 11 vs 难度 10（普通）<br>ⓘ 高骰 HR = 7（攻击伤害用此值）</div></div>"
 },
 {
  "name": "物语 暴击（同点≥6）",
  "html": "<div class=\"bubble dice rule-fu\" data-mid=\"1\"><div class=\"row1\"><span class=\"caret\">▶</span><span class=\"ttl\">检定 DEX(d8) + INS(d10) vs DL 13</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"plab\">DEX</span><span class=\"chip\">8</span><span class=\"sep\">+</span><span class=\"plab\">INS</span><span class=\"chip\">8</span></span><span class=\"sum\">→ 16</span><span class=\"badge crit\">✨ 暴击！—— 双骰同点且 ≥6</span></div><div class=\"detail\"><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>DEX d8</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">8</span></span></div><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>INS d10</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">8</span></span></div><div class=\"dline comp\"><span class=\"idx\">DL</span><span>13</span></div><div class=\"dline tot\"><span class=\"idx\">合计</span><span>骰点 16 → 16</span></div></div><div class=\"note\">ⓘ ✨ 双骰同点 8 且 ≥6 —— 暴击：无视难度必定成功，获得 1 次机会<br>ⓘ 高骰 HR = 8（攻击伤害用此值）</div></div>"
 },
 {
  "name": "物语 失手（双 1）",
  "html": "<div class=\"bubble dice rule-fu\" data-mid=\"1\"><div class=\"row1\"><span class=\"caret\">▶</span><span class=\"ttl\">检定 DEX(d8) + INS(d10) vs DL 10</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"plab\">DEX</span><span class=\"chip\">1</span><span class=\"sep\">+</span><span class=\"plab\">INS</span><span class=\"chip\">1</span></span><span class=\"sum\">→ 2</span><span class=\"badge critfail\">💀 失手！—— 双 1，失败且事态恶化</span></div><div class=\"detail\"><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>DEX d8</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">1</span></span></div><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>INS d10</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">1</span></span></div><div class=\"dline comp\"><span class=\"idx\">DL</span><span>10</span></div><div class=\"dline tot\"><span class=\"idx\">合计</span><span>骰点 2 → 2</span></div></div><div class=\"note\">ⓘ 💀 双骰都是 1 —— 失手：必定失败且事态恶化，获得 1 物语点<br>ⓘ 高骰 HR = 1（攻击伤害用此值）</div></div>"
 },
 {
  "name": "物语 带调整值",
  "html": "<div class=\"bubble dice rule-fu\" data-mid=\"1\"><div class=\"row1\"><span class=\"caret\">▶</span><span class=\"ttl\">检定 DEX(d8) + INS(d10) vs DL 13 +2</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"plab\">DEX</span><span class=\"chip\">5</span><span class=\"sep\">+</span><span class=\"plab\">INS</span><span class=\"chip\">6</span></span><span class=\"sum\">→ 13</span><span class=\"badge ok\">✅ 成功（合计 13 vs DL 13）</span></div><div class=\"detail\"><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>DEX d8</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">5</span></span></div><div class=\"dline use\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>INS d10</span><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">6</span></span></div><div class=\"dline comp\"><span class=\"idx\"></span><span>调整值 +2</span></div><div class=\"dline comp\"><span class=\"idx\">DL</span><span>13</span></div><div class=\"dline tot\"><span class=\"idx\">合计</span><span>骰点 11 + 调整项 +2 → 13</span></div></div><div class=\"note\">ⓘ 合计 13 vs 难度 13（困难）（骰点 11 + 2）<br>ⓘ 高骰 HR = 6（攻击伤害用此值）</div></div>"
 }
]